# THIS REPOSITORY IS PUBLIC AND HOLDS RELEASES ONLY.
#
# Fenrir's source is closed and lives elsewhere. Nothing here should ever be
# code. The build is attached to a GitHub Release as an asset -- releases are
# not commits, so the installer never enters git history and the repo stays
# small forever.
#
# These rules are belt and braces: a stray `git add -A` run from the wrong
# folder should fail to stage anything that matters rather than publish the
# product. If you find yourself removing a line here to commit something,
# that is the signal to stop and check which repository you are in.

# --- the application itself -------------------------------------------------
*.py
*.pyc
__pycache__/
*.spec
webui/
fenrir-scripts/
ue4ss-mod/
valheim-plugin/
IW-Scripts/
compiled/

# --- builds. Releases carry these, commits never do -------------------------
*.exe
*.zip
*.7z
*.msi
dist/
build/

# --- anything that is a credential or a person ------------------------------
sign_api_key.txt
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.*
points_balances.json
user_paths.json
legal_acceptance.json
ui_settings.json

# --- local noise ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
